  dialogueLines:
  - 'This necklace looks like it carries value. Not just monetary. I''m sure it hold
    memories too. '
  - 'Memories of the person who gave it. Like a grandparent giving it to a grandson
    as a family heirloom. Many possibilities of what it could be. '
  - That's... an oddly specific thought. Like there's some part of my subconcious
    that remembers that happening.
  - Strange. Let's keep looking.
